[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":228},["ShallowReactive",2],{"KbCiOVul4bcpdfLOrf3s8fIh4wI5YD0jNh8sNR66O4U":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":5,"excerpt":14,"hero":15,"heroAsset":30,"location":43,"sector":44,"services":51,"introCopy":52,"storyblockAccordions":53,"storyblockAssets":63,"flexibleContent":87,"footerLinkLabel":220,"footerLinks":221},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"Turnbull & Asser","Shed’s design embodies Turnbull & Asser’s spirit—authentic, crafted, diverse, and elegantly eccentric retail design",null,"turnbull-asser",false,{"hex":11},"#FFFFFF",{"hex":13},"#1C1C1C","A rich and eccentric home for the iconic royal warrant tailor and shirtmaker. ",{"title":16,"subtitle":17},"\u003Cp>Turnbull &amp;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Asser\u003C/p>",{"value":18,"links":29},{"schema":19,"document":20},"dast",{"type":21,"children":22},"root",[23],{"type":24,"children":25},"paragraph",[26],{"type":27,"value":28},"span","A rich and eccentric home for the iconic royal warrant tailor and shirtmaker.",[],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":34},900,"",1600,{"width":35,"height":36,"url":37,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":38},3200,1812,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753314-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0636-hr.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":39,"srcSet":40,"src":41,"width":35,"height":36,"sizes":42},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753314-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0636-hr.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753314-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0636-hr.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753314-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0636-hr.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753314-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0636-hr.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753314-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0636-hr.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753314-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0636-hr.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753314-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0636-hr.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753314-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0636-hr.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753314-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0636-hr.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200","(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Davis St, London",[45,48],{"slug":46,"label":47},"retail","Retail",{"slug":49,"label":50},"heritage","Heritage","Interior Design","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>All aspects of Shed&rsquo;s scheme reflect the true spirit of Turnbull &amp; Asser; authentic, always crafted, at times diverse, with a little piece of eccentricity.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[54,57,60],{"title":55,"copy":56},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>After completing the South Street showroom for Turnbull and Asser in 2014, Shed were asked by the brand to look at a new retail store, on Davies Street, Mayfair, London. The brief was to create a sister store to the original Jermyn and Bury Street flagship, whilst adopting the new retail concept.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":58,"copy":59},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>The concept was developed to embody the spirit of the original Jermyn street store, bringing a continued affinity between customers, clients and staff; all aspects of Shed&rsquo;s scheme reflected the true spirit of Turnbull &amp; Asser; authentic, always crafted, and, at times, diverse with a little piece of eccentricity.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":61,"copy":62},"The Solution","\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>The 110sqm space, spread over two floors, includes ready to wear retail on the ground floor and a bespoke lounge downstairs in the basement space. The original building, dating back to 1910, had many integral charming features which Shed felt must be kept and treasured to maintain the character of the space and to emphasise this British brand&rsquo;s heritage connections. \u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>\u003Cbr />\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003C/p>",[64,74,84],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":65},{"width":66,"height":67,"url":68,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":69},2094,1178,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753735-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0764-hr.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":70,"srcSet":71,"src":72,"width":66,"height":67,"sizes":73},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753735-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0764-hr.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753735-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0764-hr.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753735-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0764-hr.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753735-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0764-hr.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753735-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0764-hr.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753735-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0764-hr.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753735-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0764-hr.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753735-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0764-hr.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753735-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0764-hr.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094","(max-width: 2094px) 100vw, 2094px",{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":75},{"width":76,"height":77,"url":78,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":79},1036,684,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753782-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0687-hr.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":80,"srcSet":81,"src":82,"width":66,"height":83,"sizes":73},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753782-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0687-hr.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738753782-shed_ta_aug15_ja_0687-hr.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/17387537